20	/**
21	 * Central data-access layer (CLAUDE.md). All reads go through the RLS-enforced
22	 * server client, so each caller only sees rows they're entitled to. Public
23	 * provider reads select PUBLIC_PROVIDER_COLUMNS — never the server-only
24	 * bg_check_ref / payout_account_ref (no column-level RLS, so we scope here).
